---@class posthog.users.TwoFactorStatus
---@field is_enabled boolean Whether the user has any 2FA method enabled.
---@field backup_codes_remaining number Number of unused backup codes. The codes themselves are only returned when they are generated.
---@field method string|distilled.Null The primary 2FA method: "TOTP" or "passkey". Null when 2FA is off.
---@field has_passkeys boolean Whether the user has at least one verified passkey.
---@field has_totp boolean Whether the user has an authenticator app set up.
---@field passkeys_enabled_for_2fa boolean Whether passkeys count as a 2FA method.

---@class posthog.users.UpdateUserRequest
---@field uuid string
---@field first_name? string
---@field last_name? string
---@field email? string
---@field notification_settings? posthog.users.UpdateUserRequestNotificationSettingsMap Map of notification preferences. Keys include `plugin_disabled`, `all_weekly_report_disabled`, `project_weekly_digest_disabled`, `error_tracking_weekly_digest_project_enabled`, `web_analytics_weekly_digest_project_enabled`, `organization_member_join_email_disabled`, `data_pipeline_error_threshold` (number between 0.0 and 1.0), and other per-topic switches. Values are either booleans, or (for per-project/per-resource keys) a map of IDs to booleans. Only the keys you send are updated — other preferences stay as-is.
---@field anonymize_data? boolean|distilled.Null Whether PostHog should anonymize events captured for this user when identified.
---@field allow_impersonation? boolean|distilled.Null
---@field toolbar_mode? posthog.users.UpdateUserRequestToolbarMode|distilled.Null
---@field is_staff? boolean Designates whether the user can log into this admin site.
---@field set_current_organization? string
---@field set_current_team? string
---@field password? string|distilled.Secret
---@field current_password? string|distilled.Secret The user's current password. Required when changing `password` if the user already has a usable password set.
---@field events_column_config? any
---@field has_seen_product_intro_for? any
---@field theme_mode? posthog.users.UpdateUserRequestThemeMode|distilled.Null
---@field hedgehog_config? any
---@field allow_sidebar_suggestions? boolean|distilled.Null
---@field shortcut_position? posthog.users.UpdateUserRequestShortcutPosition|distilled.Null
---@field role_at_organization? posthog.users.RoleAtOrganizationEnum|string
---@field passkeys_enabled_for_2fa? boolean|distilled.Null Whether passkeys are enabled for 2FA authentication. Users can disable this to use only TOTP for 2FA while keeping passkeys for login.
---@field hide_mcp_hints? boolean When true, the user has opted out of in-app hints promoting the PostHog MCP integration after taking actions.
---@field ui_configuration? any Per-user UI customization, validated against the `UserUIConfiguration` schema. Covers SQL editor settings such as Vim mode and the vimrc. Send the complete object: it replaces the stored value wholesale. Null means no customization.

